{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9wehbbGl\">该报错是由于未向客户申请对应功能授权，所以使用AccessToken无对应功能权限（权限代码对应权限名可以参考：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1699352157034496\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">Scope权限说明</span></a>）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-wlQIbgzR\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-XMndve5L\"><strong>向客户申请对应功能授权，需要满足以下两个条件：</strong></p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-C29bdHdd\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-M5C5W4as\">APPID自身拥有对应功能权限</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-sxv3Ikvh\">申请授权时拼接scope参数中包含对应权限点，即向客户申请对应功能授权</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-k92PRGb3\"><br/></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-JUKmOEHS\" id=\"h6f20189-JUKmOEHS\">步骤一：</h3><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-CKbB2PN6\" id=\"hce1b53f-CKbB2PN6\">确认开发者应用APPID是否拥有相应Scope权限</h4><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-OkWKlCdh\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MPRimZcN\">登陆开发者账户，进入APPID管理（<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/ad_list/#/external/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">点击进入</span></a>），确认开发者是否拥有相应权限</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ie7Xg8vO\">开发者账户尚未拥有相应权限，点击申请进入提交</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-bTkaUWJD\">对于<strong>第三方角色暂不开放「客户信息与资质管理」、「代理商账号管理-创建和修改客户」、「代理商账号管理-资金和流水管理」权限</strong>，如果需要获取账户信息可以通过客户公开信息（/advertiser/public_info/）接口查询到账户名、公司名等基础信息。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-jxj5XoO0\"><br/></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-Fb58nCg5\" id=\"h6f20189-Fb58nCg5\">步骤二：</h3><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-ODYjkaFD\" id=\"hce1b53f-ODYjkaFD\">开发者拥有相应权限后需申请客户重新授权</h4><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-9GQagC24\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-55VHBTkS\">确认申请接口对应scope权限点</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-CuLFYcu0\">可以对照【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1699352157034496\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">Scope权限点</span></a>】查询接口对应Scope权限点数值</p><ol data-id=\"oa950d4e-4lTmJ8Y0\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-sIcVA0ct\">设置授权URL（注意授权URL中的<strong>Scope授权范围</strong>）</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-qHeIt0HT\">在开发者后台【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/ad_list\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #6425d0;\">应用管理</span></a>】页面选择要使用的应用程序，通过编辑进入应用基本信息页面即可查看到授权URL。</p><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-WP11trcl\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/2d6dca82c2ba4b1ba7b46f6d694512e8~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2040875518&amp;x-signature=2sA92XtXAMKf%2FcmQbLpCwMhqD0U%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-7idXEaw4\">该页面展示的为默认申请所有权限的示例，可直接使用或自定义拼装，相关参数介绍如下：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-AFVId1jp\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5y89ul2n\">其中主要包括四个元素</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t61fe7cd-CGSKSbSU\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-PewKeDEW\"><col data-id=\"cf4f8686-2iBfR86Z\" span=\"1\" width=\"15.927189988623436%\"/><col data-id=\"cdbb2b45-AJSKhfQE\" span=\"1\" width=\"12.85551763367463%\"/><col data-id=\"c31c0a57-JRd8QZB9\" span=\"1\" width=\"71.21729237770194%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-lZOLIJrq\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-Q8p03ZRM\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-I4VpKAcp\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-t9ilXYk6\">参数</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-ZWbBP8PR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AQsXiwRU\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-oedh1pLj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dcRuYdLq\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-badpTDQa\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-yJPITyQO\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yIqS4MDx\">app_id</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-nrZ3gwDR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CSHtv0Ve\">int</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-agU8qoqK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kRrVTcPN\">申请客户授权的应用程序ID（APPID）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-dJzxWKJa\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-dFCTkUMP\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SQFFXfb1\">state</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-UOClGr2S\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SCRbEKax\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-i3KQg7KW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qAAEKGR8\">自定义参数，回调时会原样带回</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-RrtIkQB0\">如：本次链接发送给指定客户，可将客户名作为自定义参数拼接授权URL并发送给对应客户申请授权，回调时以区分授权码对应的客户</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-LOJ9xJx6\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-1rVYq1DR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-in9oAd4e\"><strong>scope</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-sRyo3mVn\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0tQS6fM6\">int[]</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-kED932AO\"><br/></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-XXabeHQN\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-X7YskCZn\">申请授权接口功能范围，仅支持设置当前应用已拥有的权限点。<strong>传空则代表申请应用当前拥有的所有权限点</strong>。接口对应Scope权限点可参考【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1699352157034496\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">巨量营销Scope</a>】/【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1699625068225550\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">巨量千川Scope</a>】</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-cpRF4333\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-3iHxsoH9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BW9a6Z4e\">redirect_uri</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-p1IZ5C24\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZrvXjPD3\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-3THYRrFd\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3IiUzS5N\">即回调链接，由开发者自行提供和定义，需与APPID设置的回调链接一致，用于授权成功跳转并接受回调信息</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-Dd4y09kX\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taeb29a0-PWnjYLHk\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fENegxj5\">material_auth</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taeb29a0-dQIj8LVc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AafYFsPi\">int</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tdf77321-NZXZ3VkS\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-IoCNfowu\">是否展示敏感物料授权选项</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ol data-id=\"o2efa9a6-R7RHJZ3k\" start=\"3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FShWCAsN\">授权URL发送给客户，引导客户完成授权，重新获取Token使用即可</li></ol></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "报错“advertiser does no grant you permission”"
}
